gron	data	2	JSON to lines	Flatten JSON into grep-able lines, and rebuild it after
jless	data	2	JSON viewer	Page, fold and search large JSON interactively
tv	data	2	view CSV	Pretty-print CSV and TSV as an aligned table (tidy-viewer)
tokei	data	2	code stats	Count lines of code per language across a tree
grex	data	2	regex builder	Build a regex from example strings it has to match

